{"code":"000227","name":"유유제약2우B","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"제약","sector_desc":"의약품을 개발·생산·판매. 신약 파이프라인과 임상 결과, 약가 정책에 주가가 크게 반응합니다.","desc":"동사는 1941년 유한무역주식회사로 설립되어 의약품 및 건강기능식품을 제조·판매하고 있으며, 충북 제천에 제조공장이 있음. 종속기업으로 유유헬스케어, 유유메디컬스, YUYU VENTURES, YUYU BIO, MERVYNS PETCARE를 두고 있음. 다양한 전문의약품을 국내 병의원에 공급하고, 의약품 수탁사업과 동남아시아 및 남미에 완제의약품을 수출하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-23","n_days":300,"close":7440.0,"open":7570.0,"high":7570.0,"low":7400.0,"volume":186,"amount":1383840.0,"ret_1d":-1.847,"gap":-0.1319,"range_pct":2.2849,"ret_5":-3.876,"ret_20":-5.4638,"ret_60":1.7784,"ret_120":-31.4286,"ret_250":-28.9398,"ma20":7795.5,"ma60":7547.0,"ma120":8715.8333,"ma200":9528.0,"close_vs_ma200":-21.9144,"close_vs_ma60":-1.4178,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":54.3498,"r2_60":0.4694,"slope_120":-61.6993,"r2_120":0.6793,"slope_250":-35.2729,"r2_250":0.6268,"high52":12400.0,"low52":5810.0,"pos_52w":24.7344,"dd_52w":-40.0,"mdd_1y":-46.0154,"atr14_pct":2.573,"vol_ann_60":49.9641,"vol_avg20":633.6,"vol_ratio20":0.2936,"vr5":0.2389,"vr20":0.2641,"amount_avg5":6405614.0,"amount_avg20":4899606.0,"amount_avg60":20920020.8333,"obv_chg20":-42.5505,"turnover_20":3.9237,"pv_eff_20":-1.3925,"rsi14":41.0798,"frgn_net_5":-94.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0291,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0291,"frgn_net_20":-15.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0046,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0046,"frgn_net_60":134.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0415,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0415,"frgn_net_120":171.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0529,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0529,"foreign_ratio":0.39,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.05,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":40.0,"op_margin_q":10.8992,"op_qoq":-6.9767,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":81.8182,"rev_yoy":2.514,"op_trend_4q":4.1791,"fin_period":"202606","roe":9.66,"debt_ratio":42.21,"per":11.64,"pbr":0.94,"div_yield":1.68,"foreign_rate":0.39,"target_price":null,"recomm